"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n- Not reproducible in v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.5.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nTransparent background is not rendered correctly for tooltip panels and a solid background is shown instead.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Disable `Embed Subwindows` and enable `Per Pixel Transparency` in project settings\n2. Create a theme resource and override `TootltipPanel`'s panel stylebox with `StyleboxFlat` using a shadow size of 15(keeping everything else default)\n<img width=\"478\" height=\"194\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/311c927e-9b9f-4787-8387-3b5588bf2043\" />\n\n3. Apply the theme to the root Control node then enter some text to the tooltip text field\n4. Launch the project and hover mouse near the edge of the window\n\n**4.7**\n\n<img width=\"860\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe41fcff-0e35-4191-8d63-de8e92c5f11f\" />\n\n**4.6.3**\n\n<img width=\"839\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6801f558-60fd-47c8-9323-c754e343a205\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[transparent-tooltip-bg.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29100734/transparent-tooltip-bg.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}",